WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.040
The trouble with existing geometric models is that
they are largely built by hand.

00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:08.160
Designers craft specialized equivariant modules
that are either expensive to scale or

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:12.280
so constrained that they sacrifice expressive power,

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:16.400
and the resulting architectures grow complex just
to guarantee the physical constraints.

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:20.520
More importantly,

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:24.640
real applications increasingly demand a single
model that performs both invariant and

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:28.760
equivariant prediction with strong accuracy.

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:32.880
There is a clear need for a general, flexible
framework built on well-understood,

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:37.000
standard components rather than one-off heuristic modules.
